  {n:'Chao Phraya',pts:[{la:13.50,ln:100.50},{la:14.00,ln:100.50},{la:14.50,ln:100.50},{la:15.00,ln:100.50},{la:15.50,ln:100.50},{la:16.00,ln:100.50},{la:16.50,ln:100.50},{la:17.00,ln:100.50}],sub:'372 km · Thailand',desc:'Central Thailand\'s lifeblood. Bangkok on its banks (Chao Phraya "River of Kings"). Major irrigation (rice bowls). Floating markets.',fact:'Bangkok on Chao Phraya · Grand Palace & Wat Pho · Chao Phraya Delta (rice bowl) · Ayutthaya on river island'},
